Package: nanodRop
Title: Import Spectral Data Exported by 'NanoDrop One' Spectrophotometers
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Beatrice", "Bock", , "bmb646@nau.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2240-9360"))
Description: Reads the UV-Vis spectral text files exported by 'NanoDrop One'
    spectrophotometers into tidy long-format tables with one row per sample,
    measurement and wavelength, keeping repeated measurements and timestamps.
    Also extracts absorbance differences or ratios at chosen wavelength pairs,
    such as A260/A280.
URL: https://beabock.github.io/nanodRop/, https://github.com/beabock/nanodRop
BugReports: https://github.com/beabock/nanodRop/issues
